hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1443","[AI-translation] Aisha, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja, se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) beemar hotay to Jibreel (alaihissalam) Aap par dam kartay. Wo kehtay: Allah ke naam se, wo tumhein tandrust karay, har beemari se wo tumhein shifa de, hasad karnay walay ke shar se jab wo hasad karay, aur har nazar laganay walay ke shar se. (Muslim: 7/13)"
"1444","[AI-translation] Abdul Aziz bin Suhaib se, Abu Nadra se, Abu Sa'id se riwayat hai ke Jibreel (alaihissalam) Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha: Ae Muhammad! Kya tum beemar ho? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ke naam se main tum par dam karta hun, har us cheez se jo tumhein takleef de, har jaan ya hasad karnay wali aankh ke shar se. Allah tumhein shifa de, Allah ke naam se main tum par dam karta hun. (Muslim: 7/13). Baab: Jadu aur Yahud ka Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par jadu ke baaray mein. (Abdul Aziz bin Suhaib tabi hain, unhon ne 130 hijri mein wafaat payi.)"
"1445","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par Banu Zuraiq ke Yahud mein se aik Yahudi ne jadu kiya jinhein Lubaid bin Asam kaha jata hai. Unhon ne kaha: Yahan tak ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khayal hota ke Aap koi kaam kartay hain jabke Aap usay nahi kartay thay. Bukhari ki riwayat mein hai ke Aap dekhtay ke Aap auraton ke paas aatay hain aur nahi aatay thay. Yahan tak ke jab aik din ya aik raat hui to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne dua ki, phir dua ki, phir dua ki, phir farmaya: Ae Aisha! Kya tumhein maloom hai ke Allah ne mujhe us mein fatwa diya jis mein main ne us se fatwa manga tha? Mere paas do mard aaye. To un mein se aik mere sar ke paas baitha aur doosra mere paon ke paas. To jo mere sar ke paas tha us ne jo mere paon ke paas tha us se, ya jo mere paon ke paas tha us ne jo mere sar ke paas tha us se kaha: Mard ki takleef kya hai? Us ne kaha: Us par jadu kiya gaya hai. Us ne kaha: Us par kis ne jadu kiya? Us ne kaha: Lubaid bin Asam ne. Us ne kaha: Kis cheez mein? Us ne kaha: Kanghi, us mein phansay baalon aur khajoor ke gubaar ke khol mein. Us ne kaha: Wo kahan hai? Us ne kaha: Zi Arwan ke kuwen mein. Unhon ne kaha: To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke paas apne sahaba mein se chand afraad ke saath aaye. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Ae Aisha! Allah ki qasam! Goya us ka pani mehndi ke ghol jaisa hai aur goya us ki khajoorein shaitanon ke saron jaisi hain. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kya Aap ne usay nikal kar jalaya nahi? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Raha main, to Allah ne mujhe aafiyat di hai, aur main ne napasand kiya ke main logon par shar ubharun. To main ne us ke baaray mein hukm diya aur wo dafan ki gayi. (Muslim: 7/14). (Matboob se murad jadu kiya gaya hai; mushaata wo baal hain jo kanghi mein girtay hain; jub khajoor ke gubaar ka khol hai; afla ahraqtahu se murad nikal kar jalana hai. Ye hadees sahih sanad hai, Shaikhain ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat ki hai, aur Zaid bin Arqam ki shahid hadees Ahmad mein sahih sanad se hai. Sayyid Rashid Raza aur un ke muqallideen ne is hadees ko zaeef kahnay mein ghalti ki hai; is mein sirf ye hai ke Aap beemar hue aur Aap dekhtay thay ke Aap auraton ke paas aatay hain aur nahi aatay thay. Aur Allah ne Aap ko tashree mein ghalti se mehfooz rakha, aur Aap bashar thay, jadu ka shikar ho saktay thay jaisa Musa (alaihissalam) ko Quran ki nass se khayal hua ke rasiyan daud rahi hain.)"
"1446","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Aap ke ghar walon mein se koi beemar hota to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us par muawwizat phoonktay. Phir jab Aap us beemari mein beemar hue jis mein wafaat paa gaye to main Aap par phoonknay lagi aur Aap ko Aap ke haath se ponchti thi kyunke wo mere haath se zyada barkat wala tha. (Muslim: 7/16). Baab: Allah ke naam se dam aur panah."
"1447","[AI-translation] Usman bin Abul Aas Saqafi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se us dard ki shikayat ki jo wo apne jism mein Islam lanay ke waqt se patay thay. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Apna haath apne jism ki us jagah par rakho jo dukhti hai aur teen baar Bismillah kaho, aur saat baar kaho: Main Allah aur Us ki qudrat ki panah maangta hun us shar se jo main pata hun aur jis se main darta hun. (Muslim: 7/20). Baab: Namaz mein waswasay walay shaitaan se panah."
"1448","[AI-translation] Abul Aala se riwayat hai ke Usman bin Abul Aas Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak shaitaan mere aur meri namaz aur meri qiraat ke darmiyan haail ho gaya hai, wo usay mujh par uljha deta hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Wo shaitaan hai jisay Khinzab kaha jata hai. To jab tum usay mehsoos karo to us se Allah ki panah mango aur apne baayein teen baar thooko. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne aisa kiya aur Allah ne usay mujh se door kar diya. (Muslim: 7/21). Baab: Dasi hue ki Sura-e-Fatiha se dam."
"1449","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba mein se kuch log safar mein thay. To wo Arab ke qabeelon mein se aik qabeelay ke paas se guzray. To unhon ne un se mehmaan nawazi maangi magar unhon ne un ki mehmaan nawazi na ki. To unhon ne un se kaha: Kya tum mein koi dam karnay wala hai? Beshak qabeelay ka sardar dasa gaya hai ya museebat mein hai. To un mein se aik mard ne kaha: Haan. To wo us ke paas aaya aur us par Sura-e-Fatiha se dam kiya. To wo mard tandrust ho gaya. To usay bakriyon ka rewad diya gaya. To us ne usay qabool karnay se inkar kiya aur kaha: Yahan tak ke main usay Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr karun. To wo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se us ka zikr kiya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Allah ki qasam main ne Sura-e-Fatiha ke siwa kuch nahi padha. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) muskuraye aur farmaya: Tumhein kaisay maloom hua ke wo dam hai? Phir Aap ne farmaya: Bakriyon ka rewad lo aur mere liye bhi hissa rakho. (Muslim). (Ye hadees Sura-e-Fatiha par ujrat lenay ke jawaz mein sareeh hai.)"
"1450","[AI-translation] Aswad se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se dam ke baaray mein poocha. To unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ansaar ke aik ghar walon ko zehreelay (kaatnay) wali har cheez se dam mein rukhsat di. (Muslim: 7/17). Baab: Namla (phan si) se dam ke baaray mein. (Huma se murad zehar hai, zehreelay janwaron se murad hai, yani har zehreelay se dam ki ijazat di.)"
"1451","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne nazar, zehreelay kaatnay aur phan si se dam mein rukhsat di. (Muslim: 7/18). Baab: Bichhu se dam ke baaray mein. (Namla pehlu mein nikalnay walay zakhm hain.)"
"1452","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne damon se mana farmaya. To Aal-e-Amr bin Hazm Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak hamaray paas dam tha jis se ham bichhu ka dam kartay thay, aur beshak Aap ne damon se mana farmaya hai. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne usay Aap ko paish kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe koi haraj nahi lagta. Tum mein se jo apne bhai ko faida pahuncha sakay wo usay faida pahunchaye. (Muslim: 7/19)"
"1453","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik mard Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mujhe bichhu ne jo kal raat kaata us se mujhe kya (takleef) pahunchee. Aap ne farmaya: Khabardar! Agar tum shaam ko kehtay: Main Allah ke poore kalimon ki panah maangta hun us shar se jo Us ne paida kiya, to wo tumhein nuqsan na pahunchata. (Muslim: 8/76). Baab: Nazar haq hai, aur jab tum se ghusl talab kiya jaye to ghusl karo."
"1454","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Nazar haq hai, aur agar koi cheez taqdeer se sabqat karti to nazar us se sabqat karti. Aur jab tum se ghusl talab kiya jaye to ghusl karo. (Muslim: 7/14). Baab: Nazar se dam ke baaray mein."
"1455","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mujhe hukm detay thay ke main nazar se dam karwau. (Muslim: 7/18)"
"1456","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Aal-e-Hazm ko saanp ke dam mein rukhsat di. Aur Aap ne Asma bint Umais se farmaya: Mujhe kya hai ke main apne bhai ke beton ke jism kamzor dekhta hun, kya unhein mohtaji pahunchee hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi, lekin unhein nazar jaldi lagti hai. Aap ne farmaya: Un par dam karo. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne Aap ko paish kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Un par dam karo. (Muslim: 7/18). Baab: Nazar laganay se dam. (Zaaria se murad kamzor hai.)"
"1457","[AI-translation] Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha), Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja, se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Umm Salama, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja, ke ghar mein aik londi se farmaya jis ke chehray mein zardi dekhi. To Aap ne farmaya: Usay nazar lagi hai, us ke liye dam karo, yani us ke chehray mein zardi hai. (Muslim: 7/18). Baab: Zameen ki mitti se dam."
"1458","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab insan ko koi takleef hoti ya usay phora ya zakhm hota, Asal mein hai ke aur hoti, Muslim se tasheeh hai, to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apni ungli se yun farmatay aur Sufyan ne apni shahadat ki ungli zameen par rakhi phir uthayi: Allah ke naam se, hamari zameen ki mitti, ham mein se baaz ke luaab se, taake is se hamara beemar shifa paye apne Rab ke izn se. Ibn Abu Shaiba ne kaha ke shifa paye, aur Zuhair ne kaha ke taake hamara beemar shifa paye. (Muslim: 7/17). (Murad ye hai ke Zuhair ki riwayat pehli riwayat ke muwafiq hai jo Ibn Abu Umar ki hai.)"
"1459","[AI-translation] Khaula bint Hakim Sulamiya se riwayat hai, wo kehti hain: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Jo kisi manzil mein utray phir kahay: Main Allah ke poore kalimon ki panah maangta hun us shar se jo Us ne paida kiya, to usay koi cheez nuqsan nahi pahunchaye gi yahan tak ke wo apni us manzil se kooch karay. (Muslim: 8/76). Baab: Mard ka apne ghar walon par dam jab wo beemar hon."
"1460","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab ham mein se insan beemar hota to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) usay apne daayein (haath) se ponchtay phir farmatay: Takleef door kar, Ae logon ke Rab! Aur shifa de, Tu shafi hai. Teri shifa ke siwa koi shifa nahi, aisi shifa jo beemari na chhoray. Phir jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) beemar hue aur bhaari ho gaye to main ne Aap ka haath pakra taake Aap se waisa karun jaisa Aap kartay thay. To Aap ne apna haath mere haath se chhura liya, phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de aur mujhe Aala Rafeeq se mila de. Unhon ne kaha: To main dekhnay gayi to wo wafaat paa chukay thay. (Muslim: 7/15)"
"1461","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) is dam se dam kartay thay: Takleef door kar, Ae logon ke Rab! Tere haath mein shifa hai. Usay kholnay wala Tere siwa koi nahi. (Muslim: 7/16). Baab: Damon mein koi haraj nahi jab tak us mein shirk na ho."
"1462","[AI-translation] Auf bin Malik Ashja'i (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham zamanay jahiliyat mein dam kartay thay. To ham ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Is mein Aap ki kya rai hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Apne dam mujhe paish karo. Damon mein koi haraj nahi jab tak us mein shirk na ho. (Muslim: 7/19)"
